{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The custom attention and Q/K/V layout path is exactly bit-for-bit correct and cuts the local B=2 latency from about 0.648 ms to 0.576 ms. Only the fully fused final LayerNorm expression is too aggressive numerically (97.2% versus the required 99%); I’m disabling floating-point contraction for that kernel to preserve the reference’s four explicit FP32 operations."}}
